    "detailed_description": "Retain reference appearance without new visual style. [Shot 1] A gold coin matching the cat-face design of <Picture 1> rotates continuously in the center of a solid green background, following the exact trajectory, speed changes and orientation sequence shown in <Video 1> from 0.000s to 3.000s.",
